","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T22:05:23.248Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-023"}},{"ref":"d2","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987122005,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987122005,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":978300032,"text":"Deze bundel verenigt tien vroege verhalen van Roald Dahl over vliegen en vliegers. Veel ervan spelen in de Tweede Wereldoorlog en bouwen voort op de wereld die hij zelf als piloot leerde kennen. Onder de opgenomen teksten staat ook zijn eerste betaalde verhaal, dat aanvankelijk onder een andere titel verscheen. Het boek laat daarmee een vroeg gedeelte van zijn schrijverschap zien. De ervaringen uit de luchtvaart vormen een gezamenlijke achtergrond, zonder dat de verhalen daardoor als letterlijke memoires moeten worden gelezen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.deslegte.com/over-en-sluiten-404570/","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p048702803"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T22:05:23.248Z","reference":"work:4958","note":"Exact1988Dutch Meulenhoff paperback9789029035729 is OverToYou in KB and OL; DeSlegte exactISBN explicitly describes ten pilot stories. Same full ten-story collection, not literal autobiography. TranslatorPeterVerstegen not a primary coauthor.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-027.json","sources":["https://www.deslegte.com/over-en-sluiten-404570/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL45867W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p048702803"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":12003708,"sha256":"43da27dd8bb40ef41dc407501e623503105fd65b7d27ee548a21cd0311afe460","reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T22:05:23.248Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-023"}},{"ref":"m2","relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","key":{"edition_id":987222007},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":987222007,"work_id":987122005,"bound_author_id":978300032,"bound_title":"Over en Sluiten","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789029035729","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/12003708-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/12003708-M.jpg?default=false","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p048702803","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p048702803"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T22:05:23.248Z","reference":"work:4958","note":"Exact1988Dutch Meulenhoff paperback9789029035729 is OverToYou in KB and OL; DeSlegte exactISBN explicitly describes ten pilot stories. Same full ten-story collection, not literal autobiography. TranslatorPeterVerstegen not a primary coauthor.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-027.json","sources":["https://www.deslegte.com/over-en-sluiten-404570/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL45867W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p048702803"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":12003708,"sha256":"43da27dd8bb40ef41dc407501e623503105fd65b7d27ee548a21cd0311afe460","reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact-printing-year assertion."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T22:05:23.248Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-023"}},{"ref":"e3","relation":"editions","key":{"id":987222008},"before":{"id":987222008,"title":"De jongeman","isbn_10":"9029549777","isbn_13":"9789029549776","work_id":987122006,"cover_id":null,"language":"dut","publisher":null,"publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL47082597M"},"after":{"id":987222008,"title":"De jongeman","isbn_10":"9029549777","isbn_13":"9789029549776","work_id":987122006,"cover_id":null,"language":"dut","publisher":"Uitgeverij De Arbeiderspers","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL47082597M"},"reviewedEditionFieldKeys":["publisher"]},{"ref":"d3","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987122006,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987122006,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":987304017,"text":"In de jaren negentig begint Annie Ernaux een verhouding met een man die bijna dertig jaar jonger is. Zijn eenvoudige studentenbestaan in Rouen roept herinneringen op aan haar eigen jeugd in dezelfde stad. Hun contact maakt leeftijdsverschil en verstreken tijd tegelijk voelbaar. Reizen en gedeelde ervaringen brengen hen dichter bij elkaar, terwijl de blik van anderen de verhouding een andere betekenis geeft. Ernaux gebruikt deze persoonlijke geschiedenis om te onderzoeken hoe een nieuw verlangen ook een terugkeer naar een vroeger zelf kan worden.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.singeluitgeverijen.nl/de-arbeiderspers/boek/de-jongeman/","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p437779300"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T22:05:23.248Z","reference":"work:5180","note":"Primary Arbeiderspers and KBp437779300 bind exact2023Dutch paperback9789029549776/RokusHofstede translation and afterword. Distinct ebook/audioISBNs not imported; accessibleDaisy reuse of printISBN not mistaken for print. Fill missing stored publisher from exact library publication statement.","canonical_name_resolution":null,"stored_fields_review":{"editionKey":"/books/OL47082597M","isbn13":"9789029549776","originalEditionSha256":"52af930faab54a9d468e4638e3c91a09c16afac9891bf2cfaf17a60bab35202d","reason":"Primary Arb