not author. Artist biography identity must remain distinct."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T22:05:23.248Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-023"}},{"ref":"d6","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987122004,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987122004,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":987304006,"text":"Ruby Landry groeit op bij haar grootouders in de bayou en droomt ervan schilder te worden. Haar gevoelens voor Paul Tate botsen met de afkeuring van zijn rijke familie. Over haar eigen ouders weet zij weinig, totdat een oude foto nieuwe vragen oproept. Wat daarna aan het licht komt, dwingt haar buiten de vertrouwde omgeving naar antwoorden te zoeken. In New Orleans wacht een familiegeschiedenis die haar hoop op erkenning ingewikkelder maakt. Dit eerste Landry-deel volgt Ruby tussen herinneringen aan thuis en een onzekere afkomst.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.simonandschuster.com/books/Ruby/V-C-Andrews/Landry/9781982150532","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p119769344"],"checked_at":"2026-11-02T22:05:23.248Z","reference":"work:2973","note":"Reuse RubyWork2973 and exact Dutch DeKern1994hardcover9789032504403. KB statement explicitly credits VirginiaAndrews/translatorParmaVanLoon; primary publisher credits V.C.Andrews for Landry#1. Estate/byline credit is not sole-personal-authorship proof. Do not attach to AllThatGlitters9216 or merge parents.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-025.json","sources":["https://www.simonandschuster.com/books/Ruby/V-C-Andrews/Landry/9781982150532","https://knihobot.cz/g/8903789","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL134875W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p119769344"]},{"type":"cover_front_review","cover_id":12377658,"sha256":"bcbd64c96ecd39a3a8080c654b105c9ca